00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:28,770
Unbelievable.

248
00:17:28,853 --> 00:17:31,520
It's as powerful as Zork. Let's hope.

249
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:43,780
Exodia, how do you expect to overpower me?

250
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:48,160
You draw your strength from the
life force of a single human.

251
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:51,780
My power is derived from
the very darkness itself.

252
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,800
Is that so?

253
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:57,760
Well, observe what the life
force of a single human can do!

254
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:02,720
Alright, take this!

255
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,920
Exodia, obliterate!

256
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:10,220
Shimon, can he truly defeat Zork?

257
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:16,660
Exodia, burn through the darkness!

258
00:18:17,140 --> 00:18:20,617
I implore thee with
every ounce of my spirit!

259
00:18:20,700 --> 00:18:24,960
There is not a creature in
existence that can overcome me!

260
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:27,300
My power is infinite!

261
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:42,560
Pharaoh, I failed you.

262
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,620
No, Shimon!

263
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:48,200
I'm afraid so.

264
00:18:49,820 --> 00:18:50,650
Pharaoh,

265
00:18:50,733 --> 00:18:55,017
opposing me is futile I
am the embodiment of pure

266
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:58,460
darkness And as your world
is enveloped by the shadows,

267
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:03,260
my power shall grow Now
kneel before your new master

268
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:04,630
No,

269
00:19:04,713 --> 00:19:07,457
the light of hope still shines
upon the people of Egypt

270
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:11,320
And that light can illuminate
even the darkest of shadows

271
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:12,870
Pharaoh!

272
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:14,090
Mana!

273
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:18,180
Take this You found my puzzle.

274
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:21,177
Isis and Shimon surrendered
their spirits to

275
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:23,477
the Shadow Realm so I
could bring it to you.

276
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:26,420
I assure you their actions
will not be in vain.

277
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,150
Sork!

278
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:39,677
I face you not alone
but with the spirits of

279
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:42,320
those who gave up so
much to restore peace.

280
00:19:42,620 --> 00:19:45,920
In the name of the people
of Egypt, I shall prevail!
